@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home page";
}

<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
            <h1 class="display-4 text-center mb-4">Pyramid</h1>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
            <p>
                The Pyramid game consists of five layers. The first layer has one textbox, the second layer has two
                textboxes, the third layer has three textboxes, and so on. The player is presented with a letter of
                the alphabet in the uppermost textbox of the pyramid. The player must then enter a new word in the
                next layer while including all of the letter(s) from the previous layer.
                <br />
                When all five layers have been completed, the player's score increases and a new pyramid is generated. If the score is the highest score the player has ever achieved, it is recorded in the Best Played textbox.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
            <h3>Rules</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Each new word must contain all letter(s) from the previous layer.</li>
                <li>All words must be valid dictionary words.</li>
                <li>Completing all five layers increases the player's score and generates a new pyramid.</li>
                <li>Players have three blocks (lives).</li>
                <li>Losing all three blocks ends the game and resets the score.</li>
                <li>The highest score achieved is recorded in the Best Played textbox.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col text-center">
            <h5>Pyramid Wireframe</h5>
            <img src="/images/Pyramid Wireframe.png" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:300px;" alt="Picture of Wireframe" />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
